      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "A LinkedIn Recruiter seat contains a LinkedIn user who is licensed for specific roles within LinkedIn Recruiter. To utilize the Recruiter Prospect Interaction APIs, you will need the Recruiter Contract seatholder details in order to properly attribute the InMails to the end users in your application.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The latest API version is 202604. Use this version in the LinkedIn-Version header for all API requests to access the most recent features and improvements.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "All API requests require authorization . Additionally, API requests return paged results; details on paging through results can be found here. Requests that do not specify the start and count parameters will fail.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Person URN should be used to match the CRM user to Recruiter seatholders. The id returned in this call refers to the Seat ID, which is referenced in the other API calls as a Seat URN (e.g. urn:li:seat:123456789).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recruiter Contract Seatholders - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recruiter-contract-seatholders---crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "When retrieve seatholders for a contract, to ensure you get the expected result, pagination parameter(start=0\u0026count=10) should be passed into seatsV2 API call.\nWithout pagination parameter, API only returns ten records as default.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve seatholders",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-seatholders",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve seatholders"
